Table 8: Real-data off-path detection on RADIal: full results. Results at the original poses after a 2 ​ m 2\,\mathrm{m} lateral-shift round trip.
Mean ± \pm sample standard deviation across ten sequences;
best means are bold. ∗ denotes the ego-Doppler lift.

blocks.zh:
表8:RADIal上真实数据非路径检测:全部结果. 在 2 m 2\\\ mather{ m} 平班轮转后, 原始姿势的结果 。
平均±\pm 样本标准偏差, 跨越十个序列;
最好的手段是大胆的。 * 表示自我 - 多普勒升降机。

blocks.en:
Table 9: Synthetic off-path reconstruction. Mean ± \pm sample standard deviation across 25 scene–offset pairs;
best displayed means are bold. ∗ denotes the wrap-aware static ego-Doppler lift of RA predictions.
LPIPS is reported only for full RA and RAD.

blocks.zh:
表9:合成非路径重建. 平均 ±\pm 样本标准偏差,跨越 25 场景 - 抵消对;
最佳显示手段是大胆的。 * 表示圆觉静态自负 - 多普勒升空 RA预测。
LPIPS只报告为完整的RA和RAD.

