Table 13: Ablations on-path on RADIal: detection and Doppler. Mean ± \pm sample standard deviation across ten sequences;
best displayed means, including ties, are bold.
Doppler MAE is peak-location error at annotated cars, in bins;
it is reported here only for the Doppler-supervision comparison.

blocks.zh:
表13:RADIAL上路径的偏差:检测和多普勒. 平均±\pm 样本标准偏差, 跨越十个序列;
包括领带在内的最佳显示手段是大胆的。
Doppler MAE是附加说明的汽车的高峰位置错误,在bins中;
此处仅报告用于多普勒-监督对比.

